# NOTE: www -> apex is NOT handled here and cannot be.
# Cloudflare Pages _redirects matches PATHS only; a source with a scheme and
# host ("https://www.aidigitalcrew.com/*") is Netlify syntax and is silently
# ignored. The rule that used to live here was a no-op for that reason, which
# left www.aidigitalcrew.com serving the site directly (verified: HTTP 200, no
# redirect) while www is NOT in the Firebase Auth authorized domains — so
# sign-in fails there.
# The fix belongs at the zone level: Cloudflare dashboard -> aidigitalcrew.com
# -> Rules -> Redirect Rules.
/trending /#trending 301
